{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "c50baddf4b6ebf63b96dffade3f8e27f4b3d73ffb08d28568aec269fdbbe6860", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}。\nいつもライブの後片付けしてくれて、ありがとねぇ。", "zh": "那个呀，{$P$}，\n谢谢你总是在演唱会后帮忙整理哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97c6283a717128ba974155ec7a7ce4a4d184a8782d31ccad51c9ebb336d16a1d", "ja": "いや、どういたしまして。それより、ひなた、\nこっちこそありがとう。最高のライブだったぞ！", "zh": "不会，别客气。比起这个，我才要谢谢日向。\n这场演唱会真的很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "23fea4cffcf58c95c8a285657337457254026104fa946fa8cdd8c25c05412ef3", "ja": "わあ、本当かい……！？\nいったいどこらへんが、そう思ったんだろか？", "zh": "哇啊，真的吗……！？\n你为什么会这么想呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d99824a57dd353a21a8202b4b03e9f14498e2d8bd370afea361a3153860b49da", "ja": "みんながあったかい気持ちになれて、笑顔になれる\nステージだったからな。俺も元気をもらったよ。", "zh": "因为这是场让大家心头充满暖意，自然而然\n浮现笑容的表演啊，连我也从中获得了活力喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "a26fb3436c0afc0de7c0cbde7cdf7f996a4c6f4438a8a2cd8011b154b68ac222", "ja": "えへへ……嬉しいねぇ。あたし、見てる人が幸せに\nなってくれたらなぁって、ずっと思ってたから。", "zh": "嘿嘿……好高兴哪。\n因为我一直很希望来看我的人都能变幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "6a1359dd2d8f39eff4e72726cbec3a84a505364e286635002810b9fdb8db4848", "ja": "{$P$}にそう言ってもらえたら、\n頑張ったかいがあったよぉ！", "zh": "既然能听到{$P$}这么说，\n我的努力都值得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "08c4eb367f16b78a8914655b170b1abb10997b77c4b77112884009b2626a376b", "ja": "したっけ……もうちょぴっと上手になったら、\n田舎のばあちゃんたちをライブに招待したいなぁ。", "zh": "所以……等我变成更棒的偶像，\n真想邀请乡下的奶奶他们来看演唱会哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1007_p", "source_sha256": "18faae69e05314514a47d85da2603ec5060777254cbff2c0720ecf26c34c3bac", "ja": "お！　それは、いい考えだと思うぞ。\nいつでも用意するから言ってくれ。", "zh": "喔！这是个好主意。\n我随时都可以帮你安排的，尽管开口吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b79ba87b66c9332a1acffb569604dbc4edf0df5fb971f6fa56f32b429ef9b179", "ja": "……っと、そろそろ仕事に戻らないと。\nひなたも早く着替えて、今日はもうあがるといい。", "zh": "……啊，话说我差不多该回去工作了。\n日向你也快去换衣服，换好以后今天就可以先回去啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "02c3eb02b1a8fe4d6139e957006891f3f0e38101418eaa77dec866fd091c0189", "ja": "あ、あの……あたしにも手伝えること、ないかい？\nこんなおっきなステージなんだから、大変っしょや。", "zh": "那、那个……有没有我能帮忙的事？\n毕竟舞台这么大，你自己善后很累哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "746940306347cf8b651f1de30689bcf759f8dc0699ecaa16b5a69f3d451149c7", "ja": "気をつかわなくていいよ、片付けは俺の仕事だから。\nひなたは疲れてるんだし、早く休んでくれ。", "zh": "不用操心啦，善后整理是我的工作啊。\n日向也很累了，快去休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "7e7eb42ae21c904c37b18488c884eb540f83ecae1fe9cdf2b2c7fae811b35995", "ja": "でも、今日は楽しかったから……\nあの……もう少し……。", "zh": "不过，因为我今天真的很开心……\n那个……再一下下就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "ee01efb583aafa2c83e8874a2425e98bd715f3ecb4c27d370f20e6490e020c8d", "ja": "……ううん、やっぱしなんでもないべさ。\nわかったよぉ。じゃあ、お疲れさんでした……。", "zh": "……算了，当我没说哪。\n我知道了，那么，你辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b3719751eda8a5be93c884c36545d52602fb96771d818f317e7b68e090fde1df", "ja": "ああ、また明日な、ひなた！", "zh": "嗯，明天见，日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "cb7e5ce2466ef1aa62421d4d249712119b9c64bbdeb65a89718a0bc8b5d7fdf7", "ja": "あ、また明日……って、なんかいい言葉だなぁ。\nえへへ♪", "zh": "啊，明天见……这句话听起来真棒哪。\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1015_p", "source_sha256": "de1084738d54cf0ff3ce9ee50d51c0e255f63720850165ef015d341da79d8247", "ja": "ん？　どうした、笑って。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，为什么在笑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0034_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "64ea469c6eee60529e859ccf32322114e34da5963be7b52bb51a9893b01fe553", "ja": "ううん。\nあのね……また明日ね、{$P$}！", "zh": "没什么。\n那个呀……明天见啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
